xt-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>等级</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>人数占比</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>各等级年终奖比例</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>A级</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>30%</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>120%</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>B级</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>40%</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>100%</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>C级</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>30%</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>80%</td></tr></table>\n\n备注：\n\n（1）个人年终幸福奖金额=同级别人均年终幸福奖金额*等级比例\n\n（2）原则上人数占比按照30%：40%：30%，若考评得分过于集中，可以在此基础上合理化浮动", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//de51f2a4-7702-4639-97cd-85734a7b5275/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A11%3A04Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc07c099dff1cb4bb4588abb485c9376846b42c4fc66236e5cce689efd62a97eb"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//de51f2a4-7702-4639-97cd-85734a7b5275/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A11%3A04Z%2F-1%2F%2Fce185aab5a987c06a5de590d91260fa93a05b5607588e2b19bc5c6eb78b84ccd"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//de51f2a4-7702-4639-97cd-85734a7b5275/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A11%3A05Z%2F-1%2F%2F7ad0b72a252c0a227effc21ffda4aa1f6ae6eb22370308ba01bfd5d5ce65b9c2"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success